SUMMARY:Come see me do magic at Asian Comedy Allstars show
DESCRIPTION:20s 30s Toronto Social & Activities\nHey everyone!\n\nI am sur
 e most of you don't know this\, but I am a comedy magician. I finally get 
 to headline a big show in Toronto\, so I am hoping to get a bunch of peopl
 e out to see it!\n\nIt will be at the legendary Rivoli Toronto downtown\, 
 and it's always a fun time. It'll be me and 5 other asian comedians. I wil
 l be doing magic and comedy.\n\nTickets here: https://www.eventbrite.com/e
 /asian-comedy-all-stars-comedy-magic-tickets-2003798020821/?discount=Ken\n
 \nUse that link to get 10% off tickets.\n\nI don't perform much any more\,
  and most of you know me through the singles events. But hopefully you can
  make it to this show and maybe I will cut you in half! Jk no I won't.\n\n
 It's an Asian Comedy Allstars show\, but all are welcomed. They always get
  a wide variety of people and audience members. Hope to see you there!
