SUMMARY:Toronto Board Games Speed Dating (Ages 19-25)
DESCRIPTION:20s 30s Toronto Social & Activities\n**NOTE:** This is a paid 
 event. Please purchase a ticket to attend.\n\n**Tickets here:** https://ww
 w.eventbrite.com/e/toronto-board-games-speed-dating-ages-19-25-tickets-200
 4236630715?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true\n\nJoin us for a fun evening of
  speed dating and board games. Beverage and 2 hours of board games include
 d.\n\nCalling Toronto singles aged 19-25!\n\nJoin us for a fun and social 
 evening of speed dating and board games where you'll meet up to 15 other s
 ingles on short dates and enjoy two hours of free board games play after! 
 ***You also get a free beverage as part of your ticket!***\n\nHow Does Spe
 ed Dating Work? You will meet members of the opposite sex for quick dates\
 , and then you will give them a Like or Pass on your phone. They will then
  do the same thing for you. If there is a mutual match\, contact informati
 on will be exchanged the next day.\n\nAfter speed dating ends\, stick arou
 nd and play board games with your new friends!\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Please si
 gn up for a profile at **www.15firstdates.ca** and use the same email that
  you used on Eventbrite. We will be using our web app to run the event. Yo
 u need a profile to participate.\n\nWe will give you all needed materials\
 , and explain the process to you once everyone has arrived.\n\nThis event 
 is for people aged 19-25. For the comfort and enjoyment of our guests\, **
 *age will be strictly enforced for this event***. Please do not register i
 f you are outside of the age range.
