SUMMARY:Toronto Young & Successful Speed Dating
DESCRIPTION:20s 30s Toronto Social & Activities\n**NOTE:** This is a paid 
 event. Please purchase a ticket to attend.\n\n**Tickets here:** https://ww
 w.eventbrite.com/e/toronto-young-successful-speed-dating-tickets-200413121
 0400?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true\n\nJoin us for a curated evening of s
 peed dating with other accomplished singles in Toronto. Age 35 and under. 
 Cocktail included.\n\nReady to meet someone who matches your ambition\, en
 ergy and lifestyle? Join us at **15FirstDates Toronto Young and Successful
  Speed Dating**\, an exclusive evening designed for accomplished\, career-
 minded singles under 35.\n\nWhether you're building your career\, growing 
 a business\, or pursuing big goals\, this is your chance to meet other mot
 ivated young professionals who are just as excited about life\, success an
 d making meaningful connections.\n\nYou'll meet up to 15 other eligible si
 ngles through a series of fun\, relaxed mini-dates. **Your ticket include 
 a drink or cocktail at the gorgeous Oria on King bar.**\n\nHow speed datin
 g works is that you will meet members of the opposite sex for quick dates\
 , and then you will **give them a Like or Pass on your phone**. They will 
 then do the same thing for you. If there is a mutual match\, we will let y
 ou know the next day and you can message them right away.\n\n**IMPORTANT:*
 * Please sign up for a profile at **www.15firstdates.ca** using the same e
 mail as you did on Eventbrite. You will need a smart phone and a profile t
 o participate.\n\nWe will give you all needed materials\, and explain the 
 process to you once everyone has arrived.\n\n**This event is for professio
 nal and accomplished singles in Toronto aged 35 and under.** Dress to impr
 ess.
