 rite.com/e/north-york-board-games-speed-dating-ages-25-35-tickets-20044547
 27047?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true\n\nJoin us for a fun evening of spee
 d dating and board games. Go on short dates\, and who knows\, you might ju
 st meet that special someone!\n\nCalling North York\, Toronto singles!\n\n
 Join us for a fun and social evening of speed dating and board games where
  you'll meet up to 15 other singles on short dates and enjoy two hours of 
 free board games play after!\n\nHow Does Speed Dating Work? You will meet 
 members of the opposite sex for quick dates\, and then you will give them 
 a Like or Pass on your phone. They will then do the same thing for you. If
