 day.\n\nAfter speed dating ends\, stick around and play board games with y
 our new friends!\n\n**IMPORTANT:** Please sign up for a profile at **www.1
 5firstdates.ca** and use the same email that you used on Eventbrite. We wi
 ll be using our web app to run the event. You need a profile to participat
 e.\n\nWe will give you all needed materials\, and explain the process to y
 ou once everyone has arrived.\n\n**This event is for singles aged 25-35**.
  Get your tickets now while you can!
